WEBVTT

00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:07.300
Once upon a time, in a land far far away,

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:12.030
there was a barbaric, ruthless, and defiant,

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:16.370
demon-like bastard who thought 
nothing of his fellow man.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:21.370
Shit!

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:23.500
Why are you so cranky in 
the middle of the night?!

00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:30.630
What the hell do you want?

00:00:32.520 --> 00:00:34.480
Fine, here you go.

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.510
Damn that noise is annoying!

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:41.140
Ah! If he wants a loud noise, 
then how 'bout a pair of these?

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:47.270
Heavy Metal! Or something like it...

00:00:47.270 --> 00:00:50.520
Then I'll just raise the volume a little...

00:00:53.050 --> 00:00:57.030
Got this in the bag... Now 
while I have the chance...

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:05.870
Do you have <i>any</i> idea what time it is?!

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:08.250
Yeah! But! Baby Beel was...

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:09.790
You'll wake up the neighbors!

00:01:18.260 --> 00:01:21.800
This is a story of a high school 
juvenile delinquent who,

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:24.160
through some strange circumstances, 
is raising a baby.

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:27.680
But this baby is no ordinary baby.

00:01:27.680 --> 00:01:29.840
It is a baby Demon Lord!

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:15.960
<b>There is Nothing that Money Can't Buy</b>

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:24.940
Oga... What're you starin' at me for, huh?

00:03:24.940 --> 00:03:26.290
Wait, you're not looking...

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:27.970
W-Which is it, huh?

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:31.980
Look here, buddy... Don't go thinkin' you're 
hot stuff just 'cause you beat Kanzaki-san!

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:46.420
He's asleep while standing!

00:03:47.120 --> 00:03:49.200
Shimokawa! This is our chance!

00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:52.210
Yeah! I'm gonna make him say 
good-night, once and for all!

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:56.960
Sleep-deprived Punch!

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:03.790
What the hell does "Da-bu-!" even mean?

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:05.910
It's your damn fault I'm sleepy.

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:08.170
H-He's like some hellspawn...

00:04:08.170 --> 00:04:10.230
And damn, they lost fast.

00:04:19.320 --> 00:04:21.010
My croquet sandwich!

00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:23.180
*Munchymunchyswallow*

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:24.490
W-Where am I?

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:26.480
Crap, I must have dozed off!

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:27.850
You big liar!

00:04:29.820 --> 00:04:31.080
What's this?

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:33.080
Did Baby Beel scribble on it?

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:35.460
Oh, that must be... Yes, it's <i>that</i>.

00:04:37.260 --> 00:04:39.840
Quite a fine specimen of <i>that</i>.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:41.100
Hilda-san!

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:43.840
Where the hell did you come from?

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:47.970
Don't get excited. I simply came 
to deliver milk for my master.

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:50.550
And what the hell is it?

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:52.470
This thing is creepin' 
me out, whatever it is!

00:04:52.470 --> 00:04:54.500
Let me explain!

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:58.230
That is the Zebul Spell.

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:02.960
To put is simply, it's a symbol of 
your contract with the young master.

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:03.860
Contract?

00:05:05.550 --> 00:05:07.160
Think of it as an honor!

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:08.480
Over the past few millennia,

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:12.240
there have only been a handful of humans 
who have been recognized by a Demon Lord.

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:14.240
That doesn't make me feel better at all.

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.920
U-Um...

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:18.980
Can I ask a question?

00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:23.930
Sorry if this is a bit late... But why 
does the Demon Lord need a parent anyway?

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:27.510
You don't need parents to 
destroy humanity, so...

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:28.610
Yeah, what he said!

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:33.640
The "parent" is basically a vessel which 
enables the Demon Lord to use his powers.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:34.520
Vessel?

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:38.270
What is it now? You hungry?

00:05:38.590 --> 00:05:42.520
The power of the Demon Lord is 
influenced by the size of the vessel.

00:05:42.520 --> 00:05:47.920
In other words, to use great power 
requires a similarly matched vessel.

00:05:47.920 --> 00:05:51.530
And this Zebul Spell mark 
shows how strong you are?

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:54.500
Yes! Lord Strategist Furuichi, I applaud you!

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:55.830
How about this?

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:58.290
How do you like me now?

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:02.160
Then, as congratulations for being 
correct, I'll give you a big, warm...

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:03.200
I don't need that from <i>you</i>!

00:06:03.200 --> 00:06:04.750
Oh, I see how it is...

00:06:04.750 --> 00:06:05.970
What?

00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:08.300
What's got your goat, man?

00:06:08.300 --> 00:06:13.780
The mark will grow along with 
the master's attachment to you.

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:14.810
In other words...

00:06:14.810 --> 00:06:19.180
The power will grow the more you 
beat the crap out of your opponents.

00:06:19.800 --> 00:06:22.820
Coming ever closer to the 
true power of a Demon Lord!

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:28.820
Don't say it like it's a good thing!

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:31.380
I wanna know how to get rid of it!

00:06:31.380 --> 00:06:34.000
Then... Just don't punch anybody?

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:40.330
Understood. No more fighting for me.

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:42.980
Listen, Furuichi.

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:47.600
As long as I stop hitting people this 
mark will get smaller and smaller.

00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:51.740
Then, my contract with 
Baby Beel will be broken.

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:52.950
I've made up my mind!

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:56.590
I won't punch people! I won't 
make them grovel before me!

00:06:56.590 --> 00:07:00.110
Thus I will be what people 
call a super nice guy!

00:07:00.110 --> 00:07:02.100
Uh, no. You'd be, like, a normal person.

00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:03.040
Shut up!

00:07:06.950 --> 00:07:10.740
You broke the promise you 
just made! Excellent!

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:13.370
Aw, crap!

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:18.060
I knew it... Maybe it was a mistake 
to entrust the master to this man.

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:24.640
Himekawa-san... These are the pictures 
of Oga's wife you asked for.

00:07:24.640 --> 00:07:28.410
Nice. Good work. Here's your reward.

00:07:28.410 --> 00:07:29.390
Take it and go.

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:30.880
This much?

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:33.190
All right! Time for a yogurti splurge!

00:07:31.630 --> 00:07:33.190
A new girl?

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:34.890
Ooh, a gothic lolita!

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:37.390
And her boobs are huge!

00:07:38.000 --> 00:07:39.140
You wanna pet cow?

00:07:39.140 --> 00:07:42.600
Please, can you provide some 
more intelligent conversation?

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:45.460
I hate unsophisticated women...

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:47.100
Ooh, scary!

00:07:47.100 --> 00:07:49.400
But that's what makes you so exciting!

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:52.400
So you like unsophisticated men, huh?

00:07:55.470 --> 00:07:58.510
Never thought you'd be attacked, did ya?

00:08:03.860 --> 00:08:04.750
How much?

00:08:06.110 --> 00:08:09.510
I asked how much for me to buy your services?

00:08:10.450 --> 00:08:12.760
What? Begging for your life?

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:15.010
Take a look at the situation you're in, huh?

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:17.260
Yes, I have already...

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:21.270
And the situation I see 
is <i>you're</i> the odd man out.

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:35.950
If you're going to come up with 
a plan, make sure it's perfect.

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.470
I'll give you one chance.

00:08:38.470 --> 00:08:40.950
Tomorrow, bring this woman to me.

00:08:40.950 --> 00:08:41.990
Got it?

00:08:44.340 --> 00:08:46.210
Bro, did you hear?

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:49.220
Himekawa is starting somethin' for real!

00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:51.950
That guy's one crafty bastard...

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:54.220
It's over, even for Oga!

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:56.980
He's dead-meat for sure!

00:08:58.010 --> 00:08:59.420
Oga?!

00:08:59.420 --> 00:09:01.470
Y-You gonna...

00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:06.280
I... am against violence!

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:18.990
Coming to visit Kanzaki-san?

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:23.200
Yes, exactly. I've brought yogurti, 
so I'm sure he'll be pleased.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:26.170
Oh? I think he'll be ticked off.

00:09:26.170 --> 00:09:27.750
Don't say that...

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:30.910
Kanzaki-kun might not look it, 
but he's one of those tsundere...

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:33.260
But I can't believe Oga ran away!

00:09:33.260 --> 00:09:35.800
It must be Himekawa's doing.

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:38.010
Even the rampaging ogre has his match!

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:41.720
Hmm, maybe him beating 
Kanzaki was mostly a fluke?

00:09:42.510 --> 00:09:46.220
Sheesh... Everyone's a bit fidgety lately.

00:09:46.220 --> 00:09:48.320
The Ishiyama TKKH.

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:53.850
I suppose it's only natural with one 
of its corners, Kanzaki-kun, defeated.

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:55.880
We should also get to...

00:09:56.140 --> 00:09:57.280
Natsume...

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:01.930
If you want to run, do 
it. But I'm staying here.

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:16.800
Listen up, Baby Beel. When a man makes 
up his mind, he never ever changes it!

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:17.820
You understand?

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:21.200
I will no longer fight!

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:22.810
That is what I've decided.

00:10:24.650 --> 00:10:26.530
So, you promise as well!

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:32.310
If I keep that promise, you are not 
going to cry then, no matter what!

00:10:32.670 --> 00:10:35.490
It's a promise, man-to-man. Will you promise?

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:43.830
Are you okay with this?

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:47.330
I ended up telling him about the Zebul Spell.

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:48.670
I do not care.

00:10:48.670 --> 00:10:51.950
If he uses it to distance himself from 
the master, that would please me greatly.

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:54.420
There you go again...

00:10:54.420 --> 00:10:56.840
Aren't you actually expecting 
good things from him?

00:10:57.390 --> 00:10:58.530
I wonder...

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:04.330
If that's how he ends it, we'll know 
that he wasn't anything special.

00:11:08.150 --> 00:11:11.600
There he is! It's Oga! Oga!

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:18.740
I'm going to keep my man's promise!

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:24.580
Did he give up?

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:27.460
What's the matter, Oga? Is 
running all you can do today?

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:29.620
You can't run any more.

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:36.200
Idiots!

00:11:36.200 --> 00:11:38.710
You want me, then come and get me!

00:11:39.680 --> 00:11:44.090
But what a coincidence meeting here!

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:46.100
I really don't care.

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:47.590
Why are you following me?

00:11:47.590 --> 00:11:51.930
Now, now, Hilda-san... It's just that 
our homes are in the same direction.

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:53.260
That's...

00:11:53.850 --> 00:11:55.880
Hey, Oga's wife.

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:59.860
Ooh, wow... Just as Himekawa-san predicted.

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:03.370
Himekawa? The one from the TKKH?

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:08.740
So now you're gonna be our hostages!

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:12.160
Whoa!

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:21.220
Ow...

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:25.020
Where am I?

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:30.830
H-Hilda-san?

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:52.290
Why has Hilda-san...

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:54.470
You've got to be kidding me!

00:12:54.470 --> 00:12:56.080
Eyes open?

00:12:56.410 --> 00:12:58.580
The girl ain't wakin' up.

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:00.110
What have you done?

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:04.280
What have we done? You don't get 
the position you're in, do you?

00:13:08.720 --> 00:13:11.290
That's what you get for underestimating us!

00:13:11.290 --> 00:13:13.230
I'll melt those lips right off!

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:16.980
Don't go doing anything stupid.

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:18.860
Himekawa-san?!

00:13:18.860 --> 00:13:21.610
Himekawa? So he's the mastermind?

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:24.310
I see. This is quite the catch.

00:13:24.740 --> 00:13:26.260
And this guy?

00:13:26.260 --> 00:13:29.780
He's one of Oga's followers! We 
brought him together with the woman.

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:39.830
What the hell do you think you're 
doing, messing with my perfect plan?

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:41.110
S-orry!

00:13:41.110 --> 00:13:43.050
Sorry ain't gonna cut it!

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:44.660
You worthless trash!

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:48.140
Well, this guy has some good 
points to him after all.

00:13:48.140 --> 00:13:50.300
Hilda-san, you're awake?

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:54.330
Yes. But it seems I have been drugged.

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:56.170
I can't move properly.

00:13:57.160 --> 00:13:58.410
Now then...

00:13:58.990 --> 00:14:02.900
If you're awake, it's time 
to call Oga-kun here.

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:04.780
Will you let me borrow your cell phone?

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:07.190
Cell phone? What's that?

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:09.410
I don't have anything like that.

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:11.330
I see.

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:12.790
Stop it!

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:14.540
Service, service!

00:14:18.600 --> 00:14:20.040
This is fun!

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:22.130
But, I told you to cut it out!

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:24.800
Hold it! Stay calm there.

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:34.560
Dang. It looks like you really 
don't have a cell phone.

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:37.060
If you need a cell phone, 
then why not use mine?

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:39.080
Yes...

00:14:41.570 --> 00:14:42.710
What trash...

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:50.980
Listen, Baby Beel... You 
can't break a man's promise!

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:54.700
Shimokawa, this is our chance!

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:58.030
Oga, you bastard! How dare you 
win fights and then run away!

00:14:58.030 --> 00:15:02.560
Oga! It's finally gonna be 
a great good-night for you!

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:05.090
Out of the frying pan and into the fire...

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:08.720
Hello?

00:15:10.610 --> 00:15:11.690
Oga!

00:15:11.690 --> 00:15:14.290
Shut up! I can't hear!

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:15.470
Uh... hello?

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:17.260
Hello, Oga-kun?

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:19.230
Who the hell are you?

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:20.760
You're not Furuichi.

00:15:20.760 --> 00:15:23.400
Now don't react like that...

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:25.730
I'm making demands here, so listen!

00:15:26.100 --> 00:15:30.240
We have your wife and your friend. 
We'd like to return them to you,

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:32.640
but we need you to come here alone.

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:34.280
I-It's over?

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:40.250
Oga's takin' his time.

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:45.240
Idiots. He isn't coming.

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:47.920
He swore not to fight anymore!

00:15:48.520 --> 00:15:49.510
Furuichi...

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:55.010
I suggest you pray hard. Because if he 
doesn't show up, you ain't leavin' here unharmed.

00:15:56.950 --> 00:15:59.960
He'll come. Definitely.

00:15:59.960 --> 00:16:01.520
That's the kind of guy he is.

00:16:03.030 --> 00:16:06.700
Himekawa-san... Someone is 
here. Someone is coming!

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:08.650
Okay. Everyone, hide!

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:09.640
See?

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:21.150
What's with this big dude?

00:16:21.150 --> 00:16:23.220
Actually, he was pretty weak.

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:26.670
Sorry, but the time limit is up.

00:16:27.680 --> 00:16:30.260
Oga, you idiot! You dolt! 
You pea-brained prick!

00:16:30.260 --> 00:16:32.000
Who're you callin' an idiot, huh?

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:44.350
You bastards...

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:47.110
Goin' and getting yourselves kidnapped?!

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:51.640
Oga Punch! Punch! Punch! Punch!

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:00.720
Weren't you not fighting any more?

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:04.750
What I'm doing now is...

00:17:05.530 --> 00:17:08.530
...the Lord's justice!

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:10.230
How much?

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:14.880
How much to make you my follower?

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:22.170
Not a bad deal, I say. I'll prepare 
whatever reward you desire.

00:17:22.600 --> 00:17:26.840
With the two of us combined, running 
Ishiyama should be a cinch...

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:27.860
But, in the first place...

00:17:28.300 --> 00:17:29.900
...who are you?

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:34.500
Hey, don't play dumb!

00:17:34.500 --> 00:17:38.020
There's no way you've never heard of 
Himekawa-san if you go to Ishiyama!

00:17:38.020 --> 00:17:40.910
He's one of the TKKH! The TKKH!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.660
TK... Oh!

00:17:48.230 --> 00:17:49.440
Never heard of 'im.

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:51.990
Wow.

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:56.050
Fine. I'll fight you, punk.

00:17:56.300 --> 00:17:59.050
If you beat me, I'll release the hostages.

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:02.810
You sure you want to give up 
your hostages that easily?

00:18:02.810 --> 00:18:07.900
It's fine. Their purpose was 
only to call you out here.

00:18:08.890 --> 00:18:11.570
They have no other value to me.

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:17.080
Angry? Then, come at me!

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:19.200
Here! Hit me right here!

00:18:22.960 --> 00:18:23.950
Bingo!

00:18:24.190 --> 00:18:28.960
What you just hit was an 8mm 
ceramic plate over my stomach!

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:32.580
Now there's no way you'll 
be able to use that fist...

00:18:41.840 --> 00:18:42.710
Stand up.

00:18:44.220 --> 00:18:46.670
You had something on your 
stomach, didn't you?

00:18:49.750 --> 00:18:52.360
The Zebul Spell is reacting...

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:54.390
Nice...

00:18:56.730 --> 00:18:58.650
You're awesome!

00:19:00.440 --> 00:19:02.100
Fool! You tried to stop it!

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:05.660
That's my special 1.2 million volt stun-gun!

00:19:11.670 --> 00:19:14.690
Himekawa-san's broken out his Devil's Shock!

00:19:14.690 --> 00:19:16.920
He'll be out like a light for half a day!

00:19:19.900 --> 00:19:22.800
Baby Beel's crying hurts way more.

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:23.550
What?!

00:19:25.560 --> 00:19:26.890
You've got to be kidding me!

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:29.060
Guys, use the hostages!

00:19:30.060 --> 00:19:31.720
Okay! Don't move!

00:19:31.720 --> 00:19:34.430
If you move, then your wife is...

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:41.940
I know what you are capable of now.

00:19:42.230 --> 00:19:43.190
Begone.

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:45.720
Baby Beel...

00:19:46.550 --> 00:19:50.040
A man must follow through on 
something once he decides it.

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:52.670
I said that, right?

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:54.630
Yeah...

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:58.810
But watching your friends get done in without 
doing something? That's not being a man at all!

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:00.580
Got it?

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:06.150
W-Wait...

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:18.030
Zebul Blast!

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:48.630
I cannot believe it... He drew out enough 
power to have killed a normal man.

00:20:48.630 --> 00:20:49.470
And yet...

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:51.970
What?

00:20:53.260 --> 00:20:54.300
Let's go.

00:20:54.300 --> 00:20:55.490
'kay!

00:20:55.980 --> 00:20:56.980
Hold it, you!

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:58.980
Don't you have something to say?

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:02.530
It's not me... You made Baby Beel worried!

00:21:03.710 --> 00:21:06.490
The master does not worry for me.

00:21:06.490 --> 00:21:08.990
He is just channeling your anger.

00:21:12.560 --> 00:21:16.420
You said that, but you're 
actually happy, yes?

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:22.170
Why not simply be happy about the 
progress between him and the master?

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:24.390
It is quite something, yes?

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:26.890
Progress?

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:31.890
It is... quite something...

00:21:31.890 --> 00:21:33.140
Wow.

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:47.570
I did it again.

00:21:48.120 --> 00:21:50.160
Yeah. Sorry.

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:53.900
Don't apologize now, sheesh. I 
won't be able to sound all cool!

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:55.810
Sorry...

00:21:55.810 --> 00:21:58.670
I said, don't apologize! 
I'll kill you, damn it!

00:22:00.420 --> 00:22:02.170
What the hell is this?

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:04.620
What, you only noticed now?

00:22:04.620 --> 00:22:07.050
W-W-What?!

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:10.620
This is your fault! This is all 
your fault for gettin' captured!

00:22:11.050 --> 00:22:13.230
That hurts, damn it!

00:24:01.010 --> 00:24:05.340
Amazing, Oga! You defeated 
Himekawa from Ishiyama's TKKH!

00:24:05.340 --> 00:24:08.340
Whatever! What'll I do 
with this Celeb Pistol?

00:24:08.570 --> 00:24:10.670
Uh, Zebul Spell.

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:13.510
Anyway, the master is bored.

00:24:13.510 --> 00:24:14.840
Play with him.

00:24:17.200 --> 00:24:18.390
On the next Beelzebub:

00:24:19.150 --> 00:24:21.040
Toys Have Arrived from the Demon World.

00:24:21.040 --> 00:24:22.480
We Played Doctor.

00:24:22.480 --> 00:24:23.520
It's a double header.

00:24:23.900 --> 00:24:25.860
What kind of toys come from the Demon World?

00:24:26.570 --> 00:24:27.690
I have a bad feeling about...
